          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To divide a whole number by a unit fraction, we can multiply the whole number by the fraction&#x27;s denominator.</p>",
            "readable_text": "To divide a whole number by a unit fraction, we can multiply the whole number by the fraction's denominator.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>So, to divide <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \\div \\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}5},]</span> we multiply the <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2]</span> by <span class=\"math\">[MATH: {\\color{blue}5}\\!:]</span>\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \\div \\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}5} = 2 \\times {\\color{blue}5} = 10]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "So, to divide [MATH: 2 \\div \\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}5},] we multiply the [MATH: 2] by [MATH: {\\color{blue}5}\\!:]\n[MATH: 2 \\div \\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}5} = 2 \\times {\\color{blue}5} = 10]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>And that&#x27;s the answer! Notice that this method does the same job as the fraction model method we used before:</p>",
